    "system_id": "US12092068B2",
    "description": "Inferred conceptual model of a Pelton turbine unit that directs pressurized water through an adjustable injector onto a bucket wheel and transfers shaft rotation to an alternator. Optional sensing/control and reservoir-loop elements are represented where supported.",
